ple_and_power: 50,668 possessions in the initiation_type check\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Per-PT diagnostic of foul-ending share vs PPP; initiation_type mapping.\n- observed_verdict: artifact_found"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-011", "score": 0.116, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-011 | Study family SF-APPS-011: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- observed_research_question: Regular season vs playoff PPP by play type (DRIVE over-prediction)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: DRIVE PPP is materially higher in RS than playoffs, so an RS-calibrated optimizer over-recommends DRIVE.\n- observed_result: DRIVE RS 1.198 vs PO 0.912 (-0.286, 25 teams); PNR -0.173; PULL_UP +0.301; others within -0.07.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: DRIVE playoff PPP 0.286 below RS across 25 teams; top-10 teams all -0.30 to -0.43.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 25 teams, min 30 poss per cell; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Team-level (team, PT, context) cells, min 30 poss, up to 25 teams.\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- observed_notes: Motivated the playoff DRIVE exclusion and a proposed playoff DSI offset."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-050", "score": 0.111, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-050 | Study family SF-APPA-050: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- observed_research_question: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: A specific opponent play type on the preceding possession suppresses each star's next-possession PPP relative to that star's baseline.\n- observed_result: PUTBACK is top suppressor for 6+ stars (e.g. D. Mitchell 1.178 to 0.884, d=-0.294, n_after=95; B. Beal d=-0.345 n=32; C. Holmgren d=-0.222 n=52). Other tops: TRANSITION (A. Davis -0.058), POST_UP (N. Jokic -0.075), PULL_ [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: No multiplicity correction; n_after is 32-95 for several PUTBACK cells vs thousands of baseline possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars; min n_after=30\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}], "n_results": 4}

